  "boundary": "Exact current union dispatch and token/module joins identify the header30 AuraAction and its ordered nested consumers. BuffInput is a distinct FF/header3 wrapper containing a byte, nullable List<AssignPair> and a byte payload; it is neither the existing header5 input nor the header3 global-input profile with its member1 terminal wrapper. The inner list reuses exact instantiation17003/AssignPair td170 and the selected member6 profile in buff_92_native.json; DataPair td169 is different. TargetFilter is a distinct FF/header10 byte/enum/query structure, not BuffFilterSettings. Its R8 GameplayTagQuery context calls helper3D3C620 with output RCX and reader RDX; sixteen-byte output storage is not serialized width. BuffIconDurationSourceSetting, Sequence, TargetSettings, BlackboardDouble, DirectionSettings and ColliderShapeData reuse their separately pinned profiles only after exact context joins. The outer list reserves at least31 bytes for subsequent members; each BuffInput assignment list reserves its terminal length word. Counts, null states, required final DWORD and unknown nested stops remain explicit. Evidence is exact static identity, direct selected read order and structural-only framing. Live provider choice, Aura gameplay behavior, numeric/boolean meanings, suffix-anchor ownership and whole-BuffData EOF remain unresolved."
